            </connector>
            <label>Participants Were Changed</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>[A01-05, A03-03] [YV20-233] Called from Opportunity After Create &amp; Update when the number of groups or participants changes on an order. 1) Order lines whose product pricing method is per person (לפי אדם) get Quantity = number of participants; per group (לפי קבוצה) get Quantity = number of groups; no multiplication (ללא הכפלה) is untouched. 2) If the participants changed, they are split equally over the order&apos;s groups (remainder one by one to the first groups). The paid-order block is in the calling flow.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fBaseShare</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>FLOOR({!inNumberOfParticipants} / {!varGroupCount})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fGroupShare</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!fBaseShare} + IF({!varGroupIndex} &lt;= {!fRemainder}, 1, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fRemainder</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>MOD({!inNumberOfParticipants}, {!varGroupCount})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Subflow- Update Line Quantities by Pricing Method and Split Participants {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
